                    <span class="badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> INL 370 Project</span>
                    <h1 data-i18n="heroTitle">Navigate the Digital World with Confidence &amp; Safety</h1>
                    <p class="hero-subtitle" data-i18n="heroSubtitle">SilverAssist empowers older adults to access, evaluate, and share digital information safely and responsibly.</p>
                    <div class="hero-cta-group">
                        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-large" onclick="navigateTo('safety')"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-heart"></i> <span data-i18n="startLearningNow">Start Learning Now</span></button>
                        <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-large" onclick="navigateTo('linkchecker')"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> <span data-i18n="checkLink">Check a Link for Scams</span></button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="workshops-content">
            <div class="hero-card">
                <div class="hero-content">
                    <h1>Learn online and In-person</h1>
                    <p class="hero-subtitle">SilverAssist offers online learning and short courses, as well as in-person workshops. SilverAssist has partnered with South African retirement villages to bring the digital workshops to you.</p>
                    <div class="hero-cta-group">
                        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-large" onclick="navigateTo('factcheck')"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-heart"></i> Sign up for in-person workshops</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Learning Progress Tracker -->
