       <!-- ABOUT SECTION -->
<section id="page-aboutus" class="page-section">
    <div class="card aboutus-shell">
        <div class="aboutus-hero">
            <div class="aboutus-hero-copy">
                <span class="eyebrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-people-group"></i> Our purpose</span>
                <h1>About SilverAssist</h1>
                <p>SilverAssist is a student-led project developed by a team from the University of Pretoria, South Africa. Our mission is to empower older adults with essential digital skills and information literacy, enabling them to navigate the digital world safely, confidently, and independently.</p>
                <h1>Our Mission</h1>
                <p>We aim to make technology more accessible and less intimidating by providing simple, easy-to-understand guidance on everyday digital tasks, online safety, and identifying potential scams. Through SilverAssist, we strive to help older adults build their digital confidence while staying connected, informed, and protected in an increasingly digital world.</p>
                <h1>Our commitment to accessibility</h1>
                <p>Accessibility is at the heart of our design. The platform follows the principles of the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) to ensure that content is clear, perceivable, understandable, and easy to navigate. By applying accessibility-focused design principles, SilverAssist aims to create an inclusive digital experience that supports older adults in becoming more confident, independent, and informed digital users.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
            

        <div class="aboutus-content-block">
            <h1>Our Team</h1>
            <p>We are a diverse group of passionate individuals dedicated to making a difference in the lives of older adults through technology.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 5-MEMBER TEAM GRID -->
        <div class="team-grid">
            <div class="team-card">
                <div class="team-photo-wrapper">
                    <img src="team1.jpg" alt="Team Member 1" class="team-photo">
