            <p>If you have any questions, suggestions, or would like to collaborate with us, please reach out:</p>
            <p class="contact-email"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> Email: <a href="mailto:info@silverassist.org">info@silverassist.org</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

        <!-- 2. ABOUT SECTION -->
        <section id="page-about" class="page-section">
            <div class="card">
                <h1>Understanding Information Literacy & Ethics</h1>
                <p>Information literacy is the ability to find, evaluate, use, and share information safely and ethically.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. SAFETY SECTION -->
        <section id="page-safety" class="page-section">
            <div class="card">
                <span class="eyebrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i> Start Learning</span>
                <h1>Start Learning Online</h1>
                <p>Learn essential digital skills for the modern world. Here you will learn how to use Apps and to navigate the internet safely while avoiding scams.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="topic-grid">
                <div class="card topic-card topic-fact">
                    <h2><span class="topic-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-newspaper"></i></span> In person workshops</h2>
                    <p>Sign up for local workshops hosted at your retirement village to learn about information literacy and digital safety.</p>
                    <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="navigateTo('factcheck')">Sign up for workshops</button>
                </div>

                <div class="card topic-card topic-skills">
                    <h2><span class="topic-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-laptop"></i></span> Digital Skills</h2>
