                <h1>Sign up for In-Person Workshops</h1>
                <p>SilverAssist has partnered with retirement villages to provide local workshops on information literacy and digital safety. Bringing critical information to you.</p>
                <h2> We have partnered with these retirement villages:</h2>
                <ul class="workshop-list">
