                <h2><span class="app-icon app-icon-gmail"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i></span> Writing & Sending Gmail</h2>
                <p>Learn how to write, send, and reply to emails safely using Gmail.</p>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="navigateTo('gmail')">Learn Gmail</button>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h2><span class="app-icon app-icon-google"><i class="fa-brands fa-google"></i></span> How to Use Google Search</h2>
                <p>Learn how to search the web effectively and spot trustworthy results.</p>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="navigateTo('googlesearch')">Learn Google Search</button>
            </div>
